OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to pedestrian killed
OL,4,Ain HGV crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a man with
OL,7,F"an amazing zest for life" after he
OL,8,Fdied in a crash with an HGV.
OL,10,FAshok Suri was walking along Lake Road
OL,11,Fin Ambleside, Cumbria, when the crash
OL,12,Fhappened on 29 July, Cumbria Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FThe 77-year-old's family said he was a
OL,16,F"deep thinker" who "lived life on his
OL,17,Fown terms".
